{
  "name": "Product Hunt Daily Top Launches & Maker Founder Contact Outreach Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Product Hunt Daily Top Launches & Maker Founder Contact Outreach Pipeline\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nScrape every new Product Hunt launch daily along with maker X/LinkedIn links and website domains for warm founder outreach.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/producthunt-launch-upvote-maker-monitor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/producthunt-launch-upvote-maker-monitor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Product Hunt Launch & Maker Intelligence** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "657d8d08-8f40-452d-a946-dd814599e569",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Product Hunt Launch & Maker Intelligence** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "599b2de5-a8b1-4c66-ad94-be2c4bc3c001",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "986dd505-a6b7-4ba0-ada1-29b46ab6a8ad",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "79184700-d520-472a-a980-4c949c1e9c11",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0acc1e91-2b5b-48f8-ab04-54173080d27d",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"AI developer tools Product Hunt\",\"B2B SaaS launches today\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "a747b087-fea7-46aa-abc9-23b90afedc90",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "434b9d71-0eb3-42e2-a8cf-9d7efefacf98",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "Startups & Real Estate",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ab040946-f16c-4af5-a5ab-414300d27ba0",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
